{"reviewId": "31369487_85q2cE2Na", "review": {"abstract": "目前在座各位经历的是从衰退到萧条的转换，在座各位未来10年注定在萧条中度过，这是康德拉季耶夫不可改变的规律。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "chapterUid": 23, "content": "就说，16年，在公众场合如此说，肯定会被认为是耸人听闻，但10年后的今天看，全都命中，16-19表面经济还不错，其实是之前繁荣的惯性，已经在衰退了，19-23由于疫情，目前看26年结束的萧条，可能要延迟到27-29，然后是回升？？？", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "1813-1867", "createTime": 1765807743, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 23, "reviewId": "31369487_85q2cE2Na", "userVid": 31369487, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "author": {"userVid": 31369487, "name": "clin", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/adQQjDic8WoRoXxibnfJAA8c5V8Iiam416XUG9uu59GDI2Gr0wib4nbFgwUIRmGsIWCfERu5NwCt5ib8s9oqUDUz8Elzm41ibTFyH3n7PvmIHsPKU/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "我思故我在", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-50", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作收藏家", "levelIndex": 50}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 3, "likes": [{"userVid": 304319310, "name": "绛紫", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/RicaicdPzjqG0QRO2QdFQB3oZXD5pGjArJxbCTUHzylMoiaYzZyG1Fzbnw7NoGPZoh0qXU7ibSkOTVg/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"reviewId": "31369487_85q2cE2Na", "content": "目前没有回升